{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "capture_page",
    "description": "捕获页面图片。必填 mode：viewport 截当前可视区；full_page 截已渲染整页；element 裁剪单个元素，必须且只能提供 ref（snapshot_page/find_on_page 返回的 el-...）或 selector（唯一 CSS 选择器）。可选 tab。ref/selector 不用于其他模式，不可混用 page.* 的 id。\n整页及元素模式不滚动触发懒加载、不展开独立滚动容器，超出图像尺寸上限时明确失败。viewport 会激活目标标签以正确截图。\n返回：ok、mode、image（本地图片引用）、mime；viewport 带 image_size/viewport；full_page 带 fullPage/page_size；element 带 element_rect/capture_rect（文档 CSS 坐标）及 clipped。图像独立存储，模型附图使用实际内容，工具历史不保存 Base64。PDF 使用 save_pdf。affectsPage=false。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "affectsPage": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "const": false
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "viewport",
            "full_page",
            "element"
          ]
        },
        "ref": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^el-",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "reason",
        "affectsPage",
        "mode"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "mode": {
                "const": "element"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "required": [
                  "ref"
                ]
              },
              {
                "required": [
                  "selector"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "else": {
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "required": [
                    "ref"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "selector"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
